==Strategy==
After over nine years of suffering, Boraphim returns, now finally buffed over 100%! (He's 120%.)

While this stage might seem really scary given the crazy pushing power, the main thing to note is that the Angels first appear before the Aliens on base hit, meaning after you hit the base you need to abuse [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] and [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] as well as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to nuke the Boraphim and Gokurakko quickly, which leaves behind a simple Alien wave without much to it. [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Nova]] performs very well here, working as strong CC for the Bores as well as chipping the Lackey and Calamary, who prove to be really annoying in this stage. Once the Angels go down, Calamary and Nimoy Bore should arrive, who to counter you just make sure Nova Slows everything while [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] chips the Star Peng and Nimoy down. From there, once Nimoy goes down you can send another Bahamut to blow up the Calamary and Lackey and you should be free to beat the stage.

